Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 05:32:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09647/11362] [outer-loop] Ledger findings escalate at 1 day,
 not 7 (case H)

AMENDMENT to REQ-OPS-AUDIT-LEDGER-1 rule 3, appended to the spec. The
loop closes several milestones per day; a 7-day first escalation let the
three real 2026-08-22 CLAIM_OVERSTATED findings sit OPEN until an
operator prompt on 2026-08-23. First escalation now fires at 1 day; the
weekly re-escalation bucket is unchanged, so noise stays bounded (one
line the next day, then weekly).

Mutation: AGING_DAYS reverted to 7 -> test_one_day_old_row_escalates
RED; restored to 1 -> 11/11 GREEN.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
